msgid ""
"After launching, the Isaac Lab UI window will display a \"Record Animation\""
" button. Click to begin recording. Click again to stop."
msgstr "启动后，Isaac Lab UI 窗口将显示一个 \"Record Animation\" 按钮。点击开始录制。再次点击以停止。"

