msgstr "``Stage.usd`` — 禁用物理的原始场景"

#: source/how-to/record_animation.rst:67
msgid "``TimeSample_tk001.usd`` — the animation (time-sampled) layer"
msgstr "``TimeSample_tk001.usd`` — 动画（时间采样）图层"

