#: source/how-to/record_animation.rst:88
msgid ""
"Inside the Layers panel, insert both ``Stage.usd`` and "
"``TimeSample_tk001.usd`` as sublayers. The animation will now play back when"
" you hit the play button."
msgstr ""
"在“Layers”面板中，插入 ``Stage.usd`` 和 ``TimeSample_tk001.usd`` "
"作为子图层。现在，当您点击播放按钮时，动画将开始播放。"

#: source/how-to/record_animation.rst:91
msgid ""
"See the `tutorial on layering in Omniverse`_ for more on working with "
"layers."
msgstr "查看 Omniverse 中的 `图层教程`_ ，了解更多关于图层工作的信息。"

#: source/how-to/record_animation.rst:95
msgid "OVD Recorder"
msgstr "OVD Recorder"

#: source/how-to/record_animation.rst:97
msgid ""
"The OVD Recorder uses OmniPVD to record simulation data and bake it directly"
" into a new USD stage. This method is more scalable and better suited for "
"large-scale training scenarios (e.g. multi-env RL)."
msgstr ""
"OVD 录制器 使用 OmniPVD 来记录仿真数据，并将其直接烘焙到新的 USD 场景中。这种方法更具可扩展性，更适合大规模训练场景（例如，多环境 "
"RL）。"

#: source/how-to/record_animation.rst:100
msgid ""
"It’s not UI-controlled—the whole process is enabled through CLI flags and "
"runs automatically."
msgstr "这不是通过用户界面控制的——整个过程是通过命令行标志启用的，并自动运行。"

#: source/how-to/record_animation.rst:104
msgid ""
"The OVD Recorder uses OmniPVD, which only records **PhysX** simulations. If "
"the active physics backend is not PhysX (for example, Newton, which is the "
"default for many tasks), Isaac Lab raises an error at startup naming the "
"active backend instead of recording. Select the PhysX backend by adding "
"``physics=isaacsim_physx`` to the command line, as shown below."
msgstr ""
"OVD 录制器使用 OmniPVD，只能录制 **PhysX** 仿真。如果当前物理后端不是 PhysX（例如许多任务默认使用的 "
"Newton），Isaac Lab 会在启动时报告错误并指出当前后端，而不会开始录制。请按下例在命令行添加 "
"``physics=isaacsim_physx`` ，选择 PhysX 后端。"

#: source/how-to/record_animation.rst:109
msgid ""
"The PhysX backend requires Isaac Sim. If it isn't installed yet, add "
"``--extra isaacsim`` to the ``uv run`` command; see :ref:`installation-"
"optional-extras` for details."
msgstr ""
"PhysX 后端需要 Isaac Sim。如果尚未安装，在 ``uv run`` 命令中添加 ``--extra isaacsim`` ；详情见 "
":ref:`installation-optional-extras` 。"

